<title>GERMANY: Chirac says he wants dollar to rise.</title>
<headline>Chirac says he wants dollar to rise.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac said on Sunday that he wanted the dollar to rise in value.</p>
<p>&quot;We wish that the fall of the dollar will not continue and that this currency will rise in value,&quot; he told reporters after a meeting with German Chancellor Helmut Kohl.</p>
<p>Last week Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said he thought the dollar was undervalued in terms in fundamental economic data.</p>
</text>
